1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,460
Matthew 15

2
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:08,080
Then Pharisees and scribes came to Jesus from Jerusalem and said,

3
00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:11,920
Why do your disciples break the tradition of the elders?

4
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:15,520
For they do not wash their hands when they eat.

5
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:17,160
He answered them,

6
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:22,100
And why do you break the commandment of God for the sake of your tradition?

7
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:25,940
For God commanded, Honor your father and your mother.

8
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:30,340
And whoever reviles father or mother must surely die.

9
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:34,600
But you say, If anyone tells his father or his mother

10
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:37,560
what you would have gained from me is given to God,

11
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:39,660
he need not honor his father.

12
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:45,080
So for the sake of your tradition, you have made void the word of God.

13
00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:47,360
You hypocrites!

14
00:00:47,860 --> 00:00:50,780
Well did Isaiah prophesy of you when he said,

15
00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:53,460
This people honors me with their lips,

16
00:00:53,460 --> 00:00:55,920
but their heart is far from me.

17
00:00:56,620 --> 00:00:58,160
In vain do they worship me,

18
00:00:58,620 --> 00:01:01,760
teaching as doctrines the commandments of men.

19
00:01:02,620 --> 00:01:04,980
And he called the people to him and said to them,

20
00:01:05,720 --> 00:01:07,180
Hear and understand.

21
00:01:07,920 --> 00:01:10,980
It is not what goes into the mouth that defiles a person,

22
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:13,120
but what comes out of the mouth.

23
00:01:13,480 --> 00:01:15,300
This defiles a person.

24
00:01:16,160 --> 00:01:18,580
Then the disciples came and said to him,

25
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:22,560
Do you know that the Pharisees were offended when they heard this saying?

26
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:24,040
He answered,

27
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:28,720
Every plant that my heavenly Father has not planted will be rooted up.

28
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:30,300
Let them alone.

29
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:32,240
They are blind guides,

30
00:01:32,720 --> 00:01:34,360
and if the blind lead the blind,

31
00:01:34,820 --> 00:01:36,340
both will fall into a pit.

32
00:01:37,140 --> 00:01:38,580
But Peter said to him,

33
00:01:39,380 --> 00:01:41,460
Explain the parable to us.

34
00:01:42,140 --> 00:01:42,800
And he said,

35
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:45,880
Are you also still without understanding?

36
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:49,160
Do you not see that whatever goes into the mouth

37
00:01:49,160 --> 00:01:51,300
passes into the stomach and is expelled?

38
00:01:51,300 --> 00:01:53,780
But what comes out of the mouth,

39
00:01:53,780 --> 00:01:55,060
proceeds from the heart,

40
00:01:55,500 --> 00:01:57,200
and this defiles a person.

41
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:00,720
For out of the heart come evil thoughts,

42
00:02:00,980 --> 00:02:02,160
murder, adultery,

43
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:03,740
sexual immorality,

44
00:02:04,220 --> 00:02:06,160
theft, false witness, slander.

45
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:08,480
These are what defile a person.

46
00:02:09,040 --> 00:02:10,920
But to eat with unwashed hands

47
00:02:10,920 --> 00:02:12,660
does not defile anyone.

48
00:02:14,320 --> 00:02:16,540
And Jesus went away from there

49
00:02:16,540 --> 00:02:19,060
and withdrew to the district of Tyre and Sidon.

50
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:21,600
And behold, a Canaanite woman from that region

51
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:23,080
came out and was crying,

52
00:02:23,780 --> 00:02:28,000
Have mercy on me, O Lord, son of David.

53
00:02:28,580 --> 00:02:31,760
My daughter is severely oppressed by a demon.

54
00:02:32,460 --> 00:02:34,860
But he did not answer her a word.

55
00:02:35,300 --> 00:02:37,460
And his disciples came and begged him, saying,

56
00:02:37,880 --> 00:02:40,940
Send her away, for she is crying out after us.

57
00:02:41,600 --> 00:02:42,280
He answered,

58
00:02:42,740 --> 00:02:45,940
I was sent only to the lost sheep of the house of Israel.

59
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:48,760
But she came and knelt before him, saying,

60
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:51,660
Lord, help me.

61
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:53,240
And he answered,

62
00:02:53,780 --> 00:02:56,120
It is not right to take the children's bread

63
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:57,540
and throw it to the dogs.

64
00:02:58,360 --> 00:02:58,960
She said,

65
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:01,100
Yes, Lord.

66
00:03:01,760 --> 00:03:04,160
Yet even the dogs eat the crumbs

67
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:06,500
that fall from their master's table.

68
00:03:07,440 --> 00:03:09,080
Then Jesus answered her,

69
00:03:09,740 --> 00:03:12,220
O woman, great is your faith.

70
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:14,600
Be it done for you as you desire.

71
00:03:15,020 --> 00:03:17,940
And her daughter was healed instantly.

72
00:03:19,040 --> 00:03:20,300
Jesus went on from there

73
00:03:20,300 --> 00:03:22,080
and walked beside the Sea of Galilee.

74
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:23,760
And he went up on the mountain,

75
00:03:23,780 --> 00:03:25,040
and sat down there.

76
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:27,160
And great crowds came to him,

77
00:03:27,260 --> 00:03:29,700
bringing with them the lame, the blind,

78
00:03:29,860 --> 00:03:31,860
the crippled, the mute, and many others.

79
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:33,640
And they put them at his feet.

80
00:03:34,080 --> 00:03:35,220
And he healed them,

81
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:37,080
so that the crowd wondered.

82
00:03:37,640 --> 00:03:39,280
When they saw the mute speaking,

83
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:40,580
the crippled healthy,

84
00:03:40,740 --> 00:03:42,680
the lame walking, and the blind seeing,

85
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:45,520
and they glorified the God of Israel.

86
00:03:46,460 --> 00:03:48,880
Then Jesus called his disciples to him and said,

87
00:03:49,340 --> 00:03:51,440
I have compassion on the crowd,

88
00:03:51,440 --> 00:03:53,760
because they have been with me now three days,

89
00:03:53,860 --> 00:03:55,540
and have nothing to eat.

90
00:03:55,540 --> 00:03:57,940
And I am unwilling to send them away hungry,

91
00:03:57,940 --> 00:03:59,940
lest they faint on the way.

92
00:03:59,940 --> 00:04:01,940
And the disciples said to him,

93
00:04:01,940 --> 00:04:03,940
Where are we to get enough bread

94
00:04:03,940 --> 00:04:06,940
in such a desolate place to feed so great a crowd?

95
00:04:06,940 --> 00:04:08,940
And Jesus said to them,

96
00:04:08,940 --> 00:04:10,940
How many loaves do you have?

97
00:04:10,940 --> 00:04:12,440
They said,

98
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:15,440
Seven, and a few small fish.

99
00:04:15,440 --> 00:04:18,440
And directing the crowd to sit down on the ground,

100
00:04:18,440 --> 00:04:20,440
he took the seven loaves and the fish,

101
00:04:20,440 --> 00:04:22,440
and having given thanks,

102
00:04:22,440 --> 00:04:23,540
he broke them.

103
00:04:23,540 --> 00:04:25,540
And gave them to the disciples,

104
00:04:25,540 --> 00:04:27,540
and the disciples gave them to the crowds.

105
00:04:27,540 --> 00:04:30,540
And they all ate and were satisfied.

106
00:04:30,540 --> 00:04:35,540
And they took up seven baskets full of the broken pieces left over.

107
00:04:35,540 --> 00:04:37,540
Those who ate were four thousand men,

108
00:04:37,540 --> 00:04:39,540
besides women and children.

109
00:04:39,540 --> 00:04:41,540
And after sending away the crowds,

110
00:04:41,540 --> 00:04:45,540
he got into the boat and went to the region of Magadan.

